 table.", "How can a table help us answer questions fast? Think before you read on."]}, {"k": "recall", "t": "Tallies", "p": ["𝍸 ||| = 8."], "qq": {"id": "m3u07s2t01", "type": "num", "prompt": "𝍸 𝍸 || = ?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Application", "answer": 12, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": "12."}}, {"k": "idea", "t": "Frequency tables", "p": ["A **frequency table** shows how many times each thing happened. **Frequency** means 'how many'."], "table": {"head": ["Fruit", "Tally", "Frequency"], "rows": [["apple", "𝍸 ||", "7"], ["banana", "𝍸 𝍸", "10"], ["mango", "𝍸 𝍸 |", "11"], ["grapes", "||", "2"]]}}, {"k": "idea", "t": "Answering questions", "p": ["Most popular: **mango** (11). Least popular: **grapes** (2). Total votes: 7 + 10 + 11 + 2 = **30**.", "How many more chose banana than apple? 10 − 7 = **3**."]}, {"k": "try", "t": "Read", "p": [], "qq": {"id": "m3u07s2t02", "type": "num", "prompt": "How many chose apple?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Application", "answer": 7, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": "7."}}, {"k": "method", "t": "How do I use a frequency table?", "p": ["Step 1: Count each tally and write the frequency.", "Step 2: Find the biggest and smallest.", "Step 3: Add to find totals.", "Step 4: Subtract to compare."]}, {"k": "example", "t": "Total", "p": [], "q": "Apples and bananas together.", "steps": [["7 + 10", ""]], "a": "17"}, {"k": "example", "t": "Difference", "p": [], "q": "Mango and grapes.", "steps": [["11 − 2", ""]], "a": "9"}, {"k": "example", "t": "Complete", "p": [], "q": "Tally 𝍸 𝍸 𝍸 |.", "steps": [["15 + 1", ""]], "a": "16"}, {"k": "example", "t": "Missing", "p": [], "q": "30 children; three groups 12, 9, 5. Fourth?", "steps": [["30 − 26", ""]], "a": "4"}, {"k": "try", "t": "Total", "p": [], "qq": {"id": "m3u07s2t03", "type": "num", "prompt": "Total votes?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Application", "answer": 30, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": "30."}}, {"k": "error", "t": "Counting tally lines wrongly", "p": ["Find the first wrong line."], "q": "Frequency for 𝍸 𝍸 |.", "lines": ["3 (three bits)"], "bad": 0, "why": "Each 𝍸 is 5: 5 + 5 + 1 = 11.", "fix": [["11", ""]], "id": "m3u07s2t04"}, {"k": "mistake", "t": "Counting tally groups as 1", "p": ["Each crossed group is 5."]}, {"k": "tip", "t": "Real life", "p": ["Schools, shops and sports clubs keep frequency tables to plan."]}, {"k": "summary", "t": "What to remember", "p": ["Frequency = how many.", "Biggest = most popular.", "Add for totals, subtract to compare."]}], "video": {"src": null, "offset": 0, "dur": 600, "range": ""}, "stops": [{"id": "7.2-k1", "t": 1, "after": 0, "review": [0, 0], "note": "", "q": {"id": "m3u07s2k01", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Before you read on: a table helps us…", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "read totals quickly", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "draw pictures", "ok": false, "fb": ""}]}}, {"id": "7.2-k2", "t": 2, "after": 4, "review": [0, 0], "note": "", "q": {"id": "m3u07s2k02", "type": "num", "prompt": "How many chose mango?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Application", "answer": 11, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": ""}}, {"id": "7.2-k3", "t": 3, "after": 9, "review": [0, 0], "note": "", "q": {"id": "m3u07s2k03", "type": "num", "prompt": "Apples and bananas together?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Application", "answer": 17, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": ""}}, {"id": "7.2-k4", "t": 4, "after": 14, "review": [0, 0], "note": "", "q": {"id": "m3u07s2k04", "type": "num", "prompt": "Quick check: 𝍸 𝍸 | = ?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Application", "answer": 11, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": "